<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price of 99.90.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price of 99.90.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 2.5 percent 194th 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction, covering 60 percent of the 1.0 trillion yen issue, were as follows, the Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 99.90   Stop rate     2.512 pct</p>
<p> Average price	99.95   Average yield 2.506 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   2.1717 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	591.14 billion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 18.3872 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   April 21, 1997   Maturity   June 20, 2007</p>
</text>
